        "date": "2026-11-17T09:20:42Z"
      },
      "message": "perf(ui): resolve the generation label once, not in each repaint\n\nThe overlay called gen_progress in each frame, and gen_progress ran\nmodel::find_by_name, which scans each named entity. The running job now\nstores its label. The label is resolved when the job starts and again\nonly when doc_version changes. Pinned by\nrepaints_reuse_the_label_and_a_rename_resolves_it_once.\n\nRefs #2257\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
